  "description": "CR 605.1a, 106.6, 202.3, 202.3e, 107.3: Helga, Skittish Seer taps for mana of one color equal to its power, spendable only on a creature spell of mana value 4 or greater or a creature spell with {X} in its mana cost.",
  "note": "Helga is 2/4 and the Forests start tapped, so on turn 1 Helga is the only source: her two mana pay Hungering Hydra with X=1 (mana value 2, {X} in its cost) but not Grizzly Bears (mana value 2, no {X}). On turn 3 her two plus two Forests pay Hill Giant (mana value 4) but not Explosive Vegetation (mana value 4, a sorcery), and her two plus one Forest do not pay Centaur Courser (mana value 3).",
